ARG BASE_IMAGE=docker.io/library/python@sha256:\
2c941e860699f878900b0edc2403613c234d4b32eda3cc9fa7036991a2a63c4a
FROM ${BASE_IMAGE}

ARG TORCH_VERSION=2.12.1
ARG NCCL_VERSION=2.30.4
ARG TRANSFORMERS_VERSION=5.15.0
ARG DATASETS_VERSION=5.0.1
ARG JSONSCHEMA_VERSION=4.25.1

ENV PIP_DISABLE_PIP_VERSION_CHECK=1 \
    PIP_NO_CACHE_DIR=1 \
    PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1 \
    TOKENIZERS_PARALLELISM=false

RUN apt-get update && \
    apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends ca-certificates libibverbs1 && \
    rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*
RUN python -m pip install --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu132 \
    "torch==${TORCH_VERSION}"
RUN python -m pip install --no-deps --force-reinstall \
    "nvidia-nccl-cu13==${NCCL_VERSION}"
RUN python -m pip install \
    "transformers==${TRANSFORMERS_VERSION}" \
    "datasets==${DATASETS_VERSION}" \
    "jsonschema==${JSONSCHEMA_VERSION}"

COPY train.py /opt/uib-training/train.py
COPY entrypoint /opt/uib-training/bin/train
COPY workload.schema.json /opt/uib-training/workload.schema.json
COPY stack.lock.json /opt/uib-training/stack.lock.json
COPY configs/ /opt/uib-training/configs/

RUN chmod 0755 /opt/uib-training/bin/train && \
    python -m pip freeze --all > /opt/uib-training/resolved-packages.txt && \
    python /opt/uib-training/train.py --print-capabilities

ENV PATH="/opt/uib-training/bin:${PATH}"
ENTRYPOINT ["/opt/uib-training/bin/train"]
CMD ["--config", "/opt/uib-training/configs/tiny-public.json"]
